def sprint_history():
    out=['Git has two coarse checkpoints: `f53d771` (through Sprint 05) and `ef196c9` (Sprint 06–07 savepoint). Sprint narratives below use frozen migration increments, current source, sprint reports and handoffs. Fine-grained per-sprint Git diffs do not exist for 00–05, so exact author/file attribution beyond those records is not asserted. Historical “not started/no commits” text is interpreted at its original date, not as current status.','']
    for num,goal,before,changes,backend,db,front,security,tests,architecture,files,capability,learning in SPRINTS:
        out += [f'## Sprint {num}','',f'**Goal:** {goal}.',f'**Before:** {before}.',f'**Changes:** {changes}.',f'**Backend:** {backend}.',f'**Database:** {db}.',f'**Frontend:** {front}.',f'**Security:** {security}.',f'**Testing:** {tests}.',f'**Architecture:** {architecture}.',f'**Why:** {goal} supplied the next dependency in the operational PPM learning path; the before/after boundary above identifies the missing capability.',f'**Important files:** {files}.',f'**Final capability:** {capability}.',f'**Learning:** {learning}.',f'**Evidence:** [report](sprints/SPRINT-{num}-REPORT.md), [handoff](handoffs/SPRINT-{num}-HANDOFF.md), [acceptance](verification/SPRINT-{num}-CHECKS.md). Individual ownership not verified.','']
    out+=['## Beyond Sprint 07','','Sprint 08 durable jobs/integrations/SSE, 09 documents/retrieval, 10 AI gateway, 11 agents/semantic integration, 12–13 model training/serving, 14 copilot and 15–23 workflows/scenarios/graphs/benchmarks/audio/reports/passkeys/release are planned in [roadmap](requirements/roadmap.md). **Planned — not verified as implemented in the current workspace.** Their specification is not a completed sprint.']
    write('02-sprint-history.md','Sprint-by-sprint evolution','\n\n'.join(out))

