def tech():
    out=['Reasons are separated into recorded decisions and engineering inference. A useful alternative is not proof the team evaluated and rejected it. For each technology below, the name identifies what it is, Used Where identifies its actual boundary, and the mini-walk states internals/removal/interview implications.','', '| Technology | Used where | Problem solved | Why chosen | Alternative | Why alternative not used |','|---|---|---|---|---|---|']
    for row in DECISIONS:
        out.append('| '+' | '.join(row[:6])+' |')
    for name,where,problem,why,alternative,rejection,file,removal,question in DECISIONS:
        out += [f'## {name}','',f'**What/why here:** {problem}. **Where/code:** `{file.strip()}`. **How/internal working:** follow its {where} boundary in [architecture](03-system-architecture.md), [request trace](04-request-lifecycle.md), and the focused chapter. {why}. **Removal:** {removal}. **Alternative:** {alternative}; {rejection}. **Interview:** {question}','']
    out+=['## Planned technology is not an installed dependency','','LangChain, embedding providers, pgvector/vector stores, Neo4j, MLflow and model frameworks appear in planned architecture. **Planned — not verified as implemented in the current workspace.** They have no current application function/input/output to explain. ADRs 003/005 explain proposed choices; chapter 21 preserves their status.']
    write('25-technology-decisions.md','Technology decisions and alternatives','\n'.join(out))

